  "description": "Shared common library for ECCO Communication Manager microservices providing Result pattern for clean error handling, Azure Key Vault integration interfaces, standardized API response models, common constants (status codes, delivery methods, configuration keys), custom exceptions, extension methods, Polly retry policies, and utility helpers. Essential foundation package for all ECCO microservices.",
  "id": "ECCO.CommunicationManager.Common",
