  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.0.0-Beta (Initial Beta Release)\n\t\t  - Result pattern (Result, Result<T>, ValidationResult, PagedResult<T>)\n\t\t  - API response models (BaseResponse<T>, ErrorResponse)\n\t\t  - Azure Key Vault interfaces (IKeyVaultService, ISecretsCacheService)\n\t\t  - Constants (CorrespondenceStatusCodes with 24 status codes, DeliveryMethodCodes, ConfigurationKeys with 55+ keys)\n\t\t  - Custom exceptions (CorrespondenceException, ValidationException, SecretNotFoundException)\n\t\t  - Extension methods (ResultExtensions, StringExtensions, ServiceCollectionExtensions)\n\t\t  - Retry policies with Polly (RetryPolicyHelper)\n\t\t  - Date/time utilities (DateTimeUtility)\n\t\t  - Full .NET 8 support",
